{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011tu4RMSEb6SGA8n4r2gYqV","type":"tool_result","content":"360\t  afford `{2}` → no cast; loot fires on the opponent's upkeep but not the\n361\t  controller's; declining the loot. Seed the library by mutating\n362\t  `zones[Zone.LIBRARY]` directly, then call `draw_card` to fire the miracle path.\n363\t\n364\t### sos_97 — Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer  ({1}{B}{B} Legendary Planeswalker, loyalty 3)  — needs gaps #6, #7\n365\t- **Oracle clauses:** \"+1: Surveil 2. −1: Any number of target players each discard\n366\t  a card. −2: Return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your\n367\t  graveyard to the battlefield. −7: Flip five coins. Target opponent skips their\n368\t  next X turns, where X = number of heads.\"\n369\t- **FDN analogues:** planeswalker shape `cards/fdn/fdn_134` (Ajani — subclass\n370\t  `Planeswalker`, set `starting_loyalty`, return `LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost,\n371\t  effect, description)` list from `get_loyalty_abilities`, read targets via a\n372\t  `_resolve_target` backdoor or `controller.choose_*`); surveil `cards/fdn/fdn_157`\n373\t  (library top + `choose_yes_no`); reanimation `cards/fdn/fdn_187` (Zombify —\n374\t  `move_to_zone(game, target, Zone.GRAVEYARD, Zone.BATTLEFIELD)`).\n375\t- **Seams + new work:** subclass `Planeswalker`, `starting_loyalty=3`,\n376\t  `Supertype.LEGENDARY`, subtype `{\"Ral\"}`, color black. `get_loyalty_abilities`\n377\t  returns four `LoyaltyAbility`s whose `effect(game)` callables (each selects its\n378\t  own targets at resolution via `controller.choose_*`, honoring an optional\n379\t  `self._resolve_target` backdoor like Ajani):\n380\t  - **+1 Surveil 2:** top two library cards, `choose_yes_no` each → graveyard or\n381\t    keep on top (verbatim `fdn_157`).\n382\t  - **−1 discard:** pick target player(s) (in 2-player, the opponent and/or self\n383\t    via `choose`/`choose_yes_no`); each chosen player `choose_card` →\n384\t    `discard(game, player, card)`.\n385\t  - **−2 reanimate:** filter the controller's graveyard to creature cards with\n386\t    `card.mana_cost.cmc <= 3`; `move_to_zone(target, Zone.GRAVEYARD,\n387\t    Zone.BATTLEFIELD)` (verbatim `fdn_187` + the cmc filter).\n388\t  - **−7 skip turns:** five coin flips via `controller.choose_yes_no(\"Coin flip:\n389\t    heads?\")`; `X = number of True`; `opp_idx = game.players.index(opponent)`;\n390\t    `game.skipped_turns[opp_idx] = game.skipped_turns.get(opp_idx, 0) + X` (**gap\n391\t    #7**).\n392\t  - Loyalty costs must reduce `loyalty`; with **gap #6** Ral dies when loyalty hits\n393\t    0 (e.g. after −2 from 2, or starting-3 then −7 is illegal — `activate_ability`\n394\t    rejects it since `3 - 7 < 0`).\n395\t- **Test approach:** build a `LoyaltyAbilityInstance(source=ral, controller=p,\n396\t  loyalty_cost=ab.loyalty_cost, effect=ab.effect)` from each `get_loyalty_abilities`\n397\t  entry and call `engine.abilities.activate_ability` (needs sorcery-speed timing:\n398\t  set phase to a main phase, empty stack, active player), then resolve the stack.\n399\t  Or call the `effect` directly after manually setting `loyalty`.\n400\t- **Edge cases:** once-per-turn loyalty restriction; −7 unaffordable at loyalty 3\n401\t  (raises `AbilityError`); −2 with no ≤3-cmc creature in graveyard; coin flips all\n402\t  tails → X=0 → no skip; skip actually removes the opponent's next turn(s) (run\n403\t  turns and assert active player). Test gap #7 by setting `skipped_turns` and\n404\t  driving `advance_phase` across a turn boundary.\n405\t\n406\t### sos_120 — Improvisation Capstone  ({5}{R}{R} Sorcery — Lesson, Paradigm)  — needs gaps #3, #4  — *hardest, do last with sos_257*\n407\t- **Oracle clauses:** \"Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile\n408\t  cards with total mana value 4 or greater. You may cast any number of them without\n409\t  paying their mana costs. Paradigm (Then exile this spell. After you first resolve\n410\t  a spell with this name, you may cast a copy of it from exile without paying its\n411\t  mana cost at the beginning of each of your first main phases.)\"\n412\t- **FDN analogue:** exile-top + free-cast `cards/fdn/fdn_194` (Etali).\n413\t- **Seams + new work:** subclass `Sorcery`. `on_resolve`: pop the controller's\n414\t  library top repeatedly (`zones[Zone.LIBRARY]`), `move_to_zone(card,\n415\t  Zone.LIBRARY, Zone.EXILE)`, accumulate `card.mana_cost.cmc`, stop once the\n416\t  running total `>= 4` (or library empties). For each exiled **nonland** card,\n417\t  offer `cast_spell_free(game, controller, card, Zone.EXILE)` gated on\n418\t  `choose_yes_no` (verbatim Etali loop). **Paradigm:** set\n419\t  `self._exile_on_resolve = True` (**gap #4**, so Capstone exiles itself instead of"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"feeb00d4-a69a-45e3-8d4a-c1e07df7c37b","uuid":"273ad8a5-98da-4f6f-a0fe-c2175c7dcc15","timestamp":"2026-06-04T12:32:02.437Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/PLAN.md","content":"  afford `{2}` → no cast; loot fires on the opponent's upkeep but not the\n  controller's; declining the loot. Seed the library by mutating\n  `zones[Zone.LIBRARY]` directly, then call `draw_card` to fire the miracle path.\n\n### sos_97 — Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer  ({1}{B}{B} Legendary Planeswalker, loyalty 3)  — needs gaps #6, #7\n- **Oracle clauses:** \"+1: Surveil 2. −1: Any number of target players each discard\n  a card. −2: Return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your\n  graveyard to the battlefield. −7: Flip five coins. Target opponent skips their\n  next X turns, where X = number of heads.\"\n- **FDN analogues:** planeswalker shape `cards/fdn/fdn_134` (Ajani — subclass\n  `Planeswalker`, set `starting_loyalty`, return `LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost,\n  effect, description)` list from `get_loyalty_abilities`, read targets via a\n  `_resolve_target` backdoor or `controller.choose_*`); surveil `cards/fdn/fdn_157`\n  (library top + `choose_yes_no`); reanimation `cards/fdn/fdn_187` (Zombify —\n  `move_to_zone(game, target, Zone.GRAVEYARD, Zone.BATTLEFIELD)`).\n- **Seams + new work:** subclass `Planeswalker`, `starting_loyalty=3`,\n  `Supertype.LEGENDARY`, subtype `{\"Ral\"}`, color black. `get_loyalty_abilities`\n  returns four `LoyaltyAbility`s whose `effect(game)` callables (each selects its\n  own targets at resolution via `controller.choose_*`, honoring an optional\n  `self._resolve_target` backdoor like Ajani):\n  - **+1 Surveil 2:** top two library cards, `choose_yes_no` each → graveyard or\n    keep on top (verbatim `fdn_157`).\n  - **−1 discard:** pick target player(s) (in 2-player, the opponent and/or self\n    via `choose`/`choose_yes_no`); each chosen player `choose_card` →\n    `discard(game, player, card)`.\n  - **−2 reanimate:** filter the controller's graveyard to creature cards with\n    `card.mana_cost.cmc <= 3`; `move_to_zone(target, Zone.GRAVEYARD,\n    Zone.BATTLEFIELD)` (verbatim `fdn_187` + the cmc filter).\n  - **−7 skip turns:** five coin flips via `controller.choose_yes_no(\"Coin flip:\n    heads?\")`; `X = number of True`; `opp_idx = game.players.index(opponent)`;\n    `game.skipped_turns[opp_idx] = game.skipped_turns.get(opp_idx, 0) + X` (**gap\n    #7**).\n  - Loyalty costs must reduce `loyalty`; with **gap #6** Ral dies when loyalty hits\n    0 (e.g. after −2 from 2, or starting-3 then −7 is illegal — `activate_ability`\n    rejects it since `3 - 7 < 0`).\n- **Test approach:** build a `LoyaltyAbilityInstance(source=ral, controller=p,\n  loyalty_cost=ab.loyalty_cost, effect=ab.effect)` from each `get_loyalty_abilities`\n  entry and call `engine.abilities.activate_ability` (needs sorcery-speed timing:\n  set phase to a main phase, empty stack, active player), then resolve the stack.\n  Or call the `effect` directly after manually setting `loyalty`.\n- **Edge cases:** once-per-turn loyalty restriction; −7 unaffordable at loyalty 3\n  (raises `AbilityError`); 