ves priority).\n/workspace/engine/state_based_actions.py-349-\nengine/state_based_actions.py-350-    The outer loop: repeat { run SBA passes until stable; record whether\n/workspace/engine/state_based_actions.py-351-    new triggers were pushed onto the stack during those passes } until\n/workspace/engine/state_based_actions.py-352-    no SBAs were performed **and** no new triggers were queued.\n/workspace/engine/state_based_actions.py-353-\n/workspace/engine/state_based_actions.py-354-    Returns ``True`` if any SBAs were performed during the entire process,\n/workspace/engine/state_based_actions.py-355-    ``False`` if the game state was already stable.\n--\nengine/casting.py:53:def is_sorcery_speed(game: GameState, player: Player) -> bool:\n/workspace/engine/casting.py-54-    \"\"\"Return ``True`` if sorcery-speed timing is met for *player*.\n/workspace/engine/casting.py-55-\nengine/casting.py-56-    Sorcery speed requires all of:\n/workspace/engine/casting.py-57-\n/workspace/engine/casting.py-58-    * *player* is the active player.\n/workspace/engine/casting.py-59-    * The current phase is a main phase (``PRECOMBAT_MAIN`` or\n/workspace/engine/casting.py-60-      ``POSTCOMBAT_MAIN``).\n/workspace/engine/casting.py-61-    * The stack is empty.\n/workspace/engine/casting.py-62-    \"\"\"\nengine/casting.py-63-    if player is not game.active_player:\n/workspace/engine/casting.py-64-        return False\nengine/casting.py-65-    if game.phase not in (Phase.PRECOMBAT_MAIN, Phase.POSTCOMBAT_MAIN):\n/workspace/engine/casting.py-66-        return False\nengine/casting.py-67-    if not game.stack.is_empty():","numLines":77}}
